1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,341
Most will never make it.

2
00:00:01,341 --> 00:00:04,153
About eighty five percent are fertilised.

3
00:00:04,153 --> 00:00:06,263
Sixty percent of those hatch.

4
00:00:06,263 --> 00:00:11,679
And of the tadpoles, only three in a hundred survive to become frogs.

5
00:00:11,679 --> 00:00:16,028
Forty three adults, from two thousand eight hundred eggs.

